The Provenance Power records which text in your source files the Kiro agent changed, and prints a file with its codes in front of the text. The record is made by Kiro's own hooks when the agent works, not guessed from the text.[AI:5.1 Docs 2026-11-21T20:34:26Z.3{t=2026-11-21T20:35:15.975Z}] No prompt text is stored, and nothing leaves the machine.[AI>HUM:11.2 README section "Reveal Codes for your own repository" 2026-11-21T18:48:45Z.1{t=2026-11-21T18:57:43.165Z}]

